      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n1024✨G3陀螺官方賽✨<br />\n<br />\n兩個月一期的G3的官方賽<br />\n最後一場在今天結束囉~<br />\n感謝所有來賓的參與<br />\n也恭喜這幾次前三名拿到限定零件的朋友唷😊<br />\n<br />\n11.12月如果還有安排G3賽事<br />\n一樣會在海電電FB粉絲團公告<br />\n請大家持續鎖定唷👍<br />\n<br />\n#戰鬥陀螺 #官方賽 #台南 #海佃 #湯姆熊<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861525438_1562568199224784_4573749370854393874_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=wAJrduPFcZcQ7kNvwEHYMzC&amp;_nc_oc=AdpvKS7tgyZ0tYWbgJ24I9bDPyuGCye-hBUUueai_31UfK-GTnsQRMIHFu8uzJYalhQ&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=H_7Z7utZOpNrdAvWGZv22A&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJpeCk8OE-szoO5Frv_oCkEvrv0QXwmv7Fjsako6ApyCTnVAodUWr9MiYGztOyH7p1T0cDhDtB0&amp;oh=00_AQNPGWY8QOyWHsKPL05N6Q8P9H4uWkC_hs2O8P9S2PlYhQ&amp;oe=6AE59FE4\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/862850795_1562568812558056_5073562579851793284_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=PiSajGgGFVoQ7kNvwHJgLA8&amp;_nc_oc=Adp93f-kKWrdC0-c1NIadf0SE6dsZNNVSDfi3l6gCYRb9vXOdM_kAN9q_HQk5nPHs7U&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=H_7Z7utZOpNrdAvWGZv22A&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLWywahnxJHTMoi78TCIsFLoNm-l174TBKUlpebaIOKxy-4DtPXBFFIJiq08BNcLaipk7t2E43-&amp;oh=00_AQM8gFKWEOnBEnRz3nry9tMsSmuyYZWJeazc3RDoSFWQ-Q&amp;oe=6AE59045\" width=\"720\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/861217877_1562568825891388_430941940602498468_n.jpg?stp=cp1_dst-jpegr_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=8gGK6F23LXUQ7kNvwHBymLn&amp;_nc_oc=AdrEjwgI57wVFqHLCAAkT4ntUHil_jSGppF2qJJuvFt64vpFG5pTZgN4ZcHRKkzHCLg&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;se=-1&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=H_7Z7utZOpNrdAvWGZv22A&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKIHah4gYmGMTExr7xke26fdsPs0RaeNel-7fMcvJDDgP