      "full_text": "Photos from 湯姆熊歡樂世界-台南海佃店's post\n#TOMS品牌商品來報報<br />\n⭐TOM'S 手指彈力遊戲機<br />\n-<br />\n藍色、黑色共兩色💙🖤<br />\n可愛小型手指版拳擊台！<br />\n可切換無/有音樂模式🔕<br />\n不想太吵雜也可以安靜遊玩！<br />\n適合與親子同樂朋友聚會PK遊玩🤼🤼🤼<br />\n看看誰材質最厲害的拳(手)擊(指)手！<br />\n-<br />\n▪ 材質：塑膠 (ＰＰ)、電子零件<br />\n▪ 尺寸：10.6×14.9×18.9 cm±5%<br />\n小編分數最多５００左右💥同事打到９９９!!!<br />\n✨預計１０月中可至各現場尋寶看看哦！✨<br />\n-<br />\n✨彩票資訊：<br />\n📍 一般會員｜彩票數 2150 張 <br />\n📍 VIP 會員 ｜彩票數 1720 張<br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://scontent-fra5-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/854194253_1555400806608190_2019427815694731742_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=109&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=8swWptmtnhwQ7kNvwFFju5I&amp;_nc_oc=Adq4MhJ-nJa1hSIQZAS9ouIDP6eU9hXkcqzanM9Q_lqolNq-tJCttOTJJ8MPoP5gbNE&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=H_7Z7utZOpNrdAvWGZv22A&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQJqHHPx2PBmQqyDogH7Z7B7knJwZKoXcQULJeE5V3IUDcTGJvkCy8Z28AgNjTccOLA-tqvJ3D6o&amp;oh=00_AQMhW41RrG2x8HbYLPaGl0CBNd9rS_Uyuipc0PrvjKyaHg&amp;oe=6AE58C63\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"720\" src=\"https://scontent-fra3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/852275098_1555400836608187_8841894877258848294_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=105&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=1-DvuzMnEiwQ7kNvwGLy0uH&amp;_nc_oc=AdpfDNp4WI3BeL5gZFX1Rkmk4o_MlSTNrtdht5gbXInkcIwQA0N-FbcN96IBh4IgRBk&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.xx&amp;edm=AJdBtusEAAAA&amp;_nc_gid=H_7Z7utZOpNrdAvWGZv22A&amp;_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQKvHxpfd6x27xsTHWTChkHdewBm4CjPadg_x5_4UFxcK0kiR7hy1YtgybVtPUfI_If9fDvODyKp&amp;oh=00_AQOFykaF2fDXOgK3lrG-Oek41E5LUJID19EQEgBSWufWYg&amp;oe=6AE595F8\" width=\"960\" /><br />\n<br />\n<img height=\"720\" src=\"https://scontent-fra3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/854246055_1555400873274850_8856064918901545395_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&amp;_nc_cat=104&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=CcAbQgQTElUQ7kNvwGpzn1G&amp;_nc_oc=Adr1Bd4ea8DcS3Wu5lgIBEcaViHosdj6-IDD9iT0WlmgPQQBf9qM7azPxHhlhFw1h_I&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-